# Security headers for static hosting on Netlify / Cloudflare Pages (both
# read this file automatically). NOT read by Vercel — Vercel uses
# vercel.json instead (see that file at the project root, which carries the
# same header set). If deploying to a bare VPS/Docker instead, mirror these
# as response headers in the reverse proxy (nginx/Caddy) config.
#
# Script/style CSP allows 'unsafe-inline' because this is a static build
# with no edge runtime to mint per-request nonces: Astro emits a couple of
# small inline <script> tags (JSON-LD structured data, the no-JS/js class
# toggle) and inline styles for a few islands. If this site ever moves
# behind an edge runtime that can mint per-request nonces, swap
# 'unsafe-inline' for that instead of loosening this further.
#
# Third-party origins, and why each is allowed:
#   challenges.cloudflare.com  Turnstile bot check on every lead form (script + iframe)
#   googletagmanager.com, google-analytics.com  GTM / GA4, only loaded when an ID is configured
#   callrail.com  call tracking number swap, only loaded when configured
#   maps.google.com, google.com  embedded map on the contact page
# Keep this policy identical to vercel.json and src/middleware.ts.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://cdn.callrail.com https://js.callrail.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.googletagmanager.com; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.googletagmanager.com https://*.callrail.com; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://maps.google.com https://www.google.com https://www.googletagmanager.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
